{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-2"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810101-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","missionId":"event-rogue-2","mission":"유목 광부","scene":"유목 광부","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"해가 질 무렵, 당신은 뜨거운 용암 위에 서 있다. 광맥이 버터처럼 녹아내리는 열기 속에서 잠시 동안 현기증을 느낀다","talkId":403810101,"textHash":"1467369889819009703","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:2/talk-403810101","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d8933c18e250ceb9","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810102-line"],"bwikiPage":"游牧矿工","bwikiRevision":58642,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9307","bwikiMission":"유목 광부"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810102-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","missionId":"event-rogue-2","mission":"유목 광부","scene":"유목 광부","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「위대한 보존 에이언즈 클리포트여… 우리의 기도를 들어주실 거야」 광부들이 철삽을 끊임없이 내리치는 이 광경은 마치 열광적인 동물 같기도, 광신도 같기도 하다","talkId":403810102,"textHash":"2918451673552035478","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:2/talk-403810102","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d8933c18e250ceb9","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810103-line"],"bwikiPage":"游牧矿工","bwikiRevision":58642,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9307","bwikiMission":"유목 광부"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810103-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","missionId":"event-rogue-2","mission":"유목 광부","scene":"유목 광부","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"누군가 탐사등을 쓴 *광부 1호*인 당신을 발견한다. 거뭇한 피부의 건장한 어깨를 가진 그의 까만 입술 사이로 금니 하나가 보이더니, 끊임없는 확대와 왜곡을 거쳐 결국 이제는 그의 *미소*만을 볼 수 있다. 그의 미소는 입술과 눈이 마치 팔레트의 물감이 녹아내리듯 한데 뭉쳐 있다","talkId":403810103,"textHash":"13436520689649547379","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:2/talk-403810103","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d8933c18e250ceb9","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810104-line"],"bwikiPage":"游牧矿工","bwikiRevision":58642,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9307","bwikiMission":"유목 광부"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-talk-403810104-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","missionId":"event-rogue-2","mission":"유목 광부","scene":"유목 광부","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「앰버 로드의 은총으로 『클리포트』가 이 광맥을 보존하시니, 당신은 이 중 하나를 가져갈 수 있다」","talkId":403810104,"textHash":"9273757547209802424","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:2/talk-403810104","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"d8933c18e250ceb9","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"游牧矿工","bwikiRevision":58642,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9307","bwikiMission":"유목 광부"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-7539100505255928878-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","missionId":"event-rogue-2","mission":"유목 광부","scene":"유목 광부","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"앰버 로드에게 바친다","talkId":null,"textHash":"7539100505255928878","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:2/text-7539100505255928878","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"976602b1031c76fb","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-5276501885006340340-effect"],"bwikiPage":"游牧矿工","bwikiRevision":58642,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9307","bwikiMission":"유목 광부"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-2-text-5276501885006340340-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-2","missionId":"event-rogue-2","mission":"유목 광부","scene":"유목 광부","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"강화한 ★2 「보존」의 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"5276501885006340340","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:2/text-5276501885006340340","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"976602b1031c76fb","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"游牧矿工","bwikiRevision":58642,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-9307","bwikiMission":"유목 광부","bwikiReply